<view class="page">
  <view class="banner">订单详情仅用于测试 · 虚构取件码 · 未付款</view>
  <view class="title">订单详情</view>
  <button class="button button-secondary" bindtap="refresh" disabled="{{loading}}">刷新状态</button>
  <view class="muted">页面可见时约每 15 秒同步；最近更新 {{lastUpdated || '尚未成功同步'}}。关键操作前请以服务端返回为准。</view>
  <view class="error" wx:if="{{error}}">{{error}}</view>
  <view class="card" wx:if="{{order}}">
    <view class="row"><text class="card-title">{{order.campusName}} · {{order.zone}}{{order.building ? ' · ' + order.building : ''}}</text><text class="pill">{{order.statusName}}</text></view>
    <view class="section-kicker">配送进度</view>
    <view class="timeline" aria-label="订单进度">
      <view class="timeline-step state-{{item.state}}" wx:for="{{order.progressSteps}}" wx:key="key">
        <view class="timeline-dot"></view><text>{{item.title}}</text>
      </view>
    </view>
    <view class="field">包裹 {{order.qty}} 件 · {{order.slotName}}</view>
    <view class="field">模拟报价 ¥{{order.amountText}} · 未付款</view>
    <view class="field" wx:if="{{order.handoff}}">楼下当面交接点：{{order.handoff}}</view>
    <view class="field" wx:for="{{order.pickup_codes}}" wx:key="index">第 {{index + 1}} 件虚构取件码：{{item}}</view>
    <view class="notice" wx:if="{{canIssueHandoff}}">楼下见到代取员并核对包裹后，生成一次性演示交接码，当面告诉对方。5 分钟内有效。</view>
    <button class="button button-secondary" wx:if="{{canIssueHandoff}}" data-action="handoff-code" disabled="{{busy}}" bindtap="doAction">生成演示交接码</button>
    <view class="field" wx:if="{{canIssueHandoff && handoffCode}}">本次交接码：{{handoffCode}}（只供当面告知代取员）</view>
    <view wx:if="{{canProgress && nextStatus === 'delivered'}}"><view class="label">学生当面提供的 6 位交接码</view><input class="control" type="number" maxlength="6" value="{{enteredHandoffCode}}" bindinput="changeHandoffCode" placeholder="请输入交接码" /></view>
    <view class="notice" wx:if="{{order.exception}}">异常已暂停履约：{{order.exceptionReason}}。本校区管理员核实后处理，请刷新查看结果。</view>
    <view class="muted" wx:if="{{order.lastResolution}}">最近一次异常处理：{{order.lastResolutionText}}</view>
    <view class="muted">编号 {{order.shortId}} · {{order.createdText}}</view>
    <button class="button button-danger" wx:if="{{canCancel}}" data-action="cancel" disabled="{{busy}}" bindtap="doAction">取消测试订单</button>
    <button class="button" wx:if="{{canConfirm}}" data-action="confirm" disabled="{{busy}}" bindtap="doAction">确认收货</button>
    <button class="button" wx:if="{{canProgress}}" data-action="progress" disabled="{{busy}}" bindtap="doAction">{{nextLabel}}</button>
    <view wx:if="{{canReport}}"><view class="label">发生异常？上报后暂停配送，由本校区管理员核实。</view><picker range="{{reasonOptions}}" value="{{reasonIndex}}" bindchange="changeReason"><view class="control">{{reasonOptions[reasonIndex]}}</view></picker><button class="button button-secondary" data-action="exception" disabled="{{busy}}" bindtap="doAction">上报测试异常</button></view>
  </view>
</view>
